<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>난임 부부 공동 캘린더</title>
  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: #faf7f5;
      color: #2f2f2f;
    }

    .app {
      max-width: 420px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: #fff;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    header {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 24px;
      margin: 0 0 8px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .partner-box {
      background: #fff3f0;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .partner-box strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .partner-box span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
    }

    .calendar-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .calendar-header h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .calendar {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(7, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .day-name {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #999;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .day {
      min-height: 56px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f8f8f8;
      padding: 8px;
      font-size: 13px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .day.active {
      background: #ffe8e2;
      border: 1px solid #ffb7a8;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 8px;
      margin-right: 3px;
    }

    .ovulation { background: #ff7aa2; }
    .hospital { background: #5b8def; }
    .procedure { background: #9b6ef3; }

    .section-title {
      font-size: 17px;
      margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .event-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .event-card {
      border: 1px solid #eee;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .event-card h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .event-meta {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #666;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .tag {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: #f1f1f1;
    }

    form {
      border-top: 1px solid #eee;
      padding-top: 20px;
    }

    label {
      display: block;
      font-size: 13px;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      color: #555;
    }

    input, select, textarea {
      width: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #ddd;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    textarea {
      resize: none;
      min-height: 80px;
    }

    button {
      width: 100%;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #ff7f6e;
      color: white;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button:hover {
      background: #f36f5e;
    }

    .notice {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <header>
      <h1>공동 캘린더</h1>
      <p>배란일, 병원 일정, 시술 일정을 배우자와 함께 관리해요.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="partner-box">
      <strong>배우자와 연결됨</strong>
      <span>이 캘린더는 배우자로 등록된 사용자와 함께 공유됩니다.</span>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="calendar-header">
        <h2>2026년 5월</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="calendar">
        <div class="day-name">일</div>
        <div class="day-name">월</div>
        <div class="day-name">화</div>
        <div class="day-name">수</div>
        <div class="day-name">목</div>
        <div class="day-name">금</div>
        <div class="day-name">토</div>

        <div class="day">1</div>
        <div class="day">2</div>
        <div class="day">3</div>
        <div class="day active">4<br><span class="dot ovulation"></span></div>
        <div class="day">5</div>
        <div class="day">6</div>
        <div class="day">7</div>

        <div class="day">8</div>
        <div class="day">9</div>
        <div class="day active">10<br><span class="dot hospital"></span></div>
        <div class="day">11</div>
        <div class="day">12</div>
        <div class="day active">13<br><span class="dot procedure"></span></div>
        <div class="day">14</div>

        <div class="day">15</div>
        <div class="day">16</div>
        <div class="day">17</div>
        <div class="day">18</div>
        <div class="day">19</div>
        <div class="day">20</div>
        <div class="day">21</div>

        <div class="day">22</div>
        <div class="day">23</div>
        <div class="day">24</div>
        <div class="day">25</div>
        <div class="day">26</div>
        <div class="day">27</div>
        <div class="day">28</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="section-title">공유 일정</h2>

      <div class="event-list">
        <div class="event-card">
          <span class="tag">배란일</span>
          <h3>배란 예정일</h3>
          <div class="event-meta">
            날짜: 2026.05.04<br />
            참여자: 부부 모두 확인<br />
            등록자: 나
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <span class="tag">병원 방문</span>
          <h3>난임 클리닉 진료</h3>
          <div class="event-meta">
            날짜: 2026.05.10 오전 10:30<br />
            참여자: 함께 방문<br />
            등록자: 배우자
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="event-card">
          <span class="tag">시술 일정</span>
          <h3>시험관 시술 상담</h3>
          <div class="event-meta">
            날짜: 2026.05.13 오후 2:00<br />
            참여자: 아내 방문<br />
            등록자: 나
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <form>
      <h2 class="section-title">일정 등록</h2>

      <label for="event-title">일정 제목</label>
      <input id="event-title" type="text" placeholder="예: 병원 방문" />

      <label for="event-type">일정 유형</label>
      <select id="event-type">
        <option>배란일</option>
        <option>병원 일정</option>
        <option>시술 일정</option>
        <option>기타</option>
      </select>

      <label for="event-date">날짜</label>
      <input id="event-date" type="date" />

      <label for="event-time">시간</label>
      <input id="event-time" type="time" />

      <label for="participant">참여자</label>
      <select id="participant">
        <option>아내 방문</option>
        <option>남편 방문</option>
        <option>함께 방문</option>
        <option>일정 공유만</option>
      </select>

      <label for="memo">메모</label>
      <textarea id="memo" placeholder="병원명, 준비물, 담당 의사 등을 입력하세요."></textarea>

      <button type="button" onclick="alert('일정이 배우자와 공유되는 캘린더에 등록되었습니다.')">
        공동 캘린더에 등록
      </button>

      <p class="notice">
        등록한 일정은 내 계정에만 저장되는 것이 아니라, 배우자로 연결된 사용자의 캘린더에도 함께 표시됩니다.
      </p>
    </form>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
